# Summary

The statute specifies that records of the society are retained for the period named in the schedule of this statute. [[cite:obs-23b8690000a7c06efc0961c425a51a2945b0dbd3 "Records of the society are retained for the period named in the schedule of this statute."]]

The schedule states that records are kept for eleven years. [[cite:obs-23b8690000a7c06efc0961c425a51a2945b0dbd3 "Records of the society are retained for the period named in the schedule of this statute."]]